      "answer": "Use JSON. POST /events takes {\"seats\": <positive integer>} and returns {\"id\": <string>, \"seats\": <integer>, \"available\": <integer>}. POST /events/{id}/reservations takes {} and reserves one seat, returning {\"event_id\": <string>, \"available\": <integer>}. Start locally with python -m shiploop; run tests with python -m unittest discover. These names and shapes are assumptions for discovery to validate."
